## Command

```shell
biome inspect config linter.rules.suspicious.noConsole --path=file.test.js
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "linter": {
    "rules": { "suspicious": "error" }
  },
  "overrides": [
    {
      "includes": ["**/*.test.js"],
      "linter": {
        "rules": {
          "suspicious": { "noDebugger": "off" }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

